        "content": "# 📈 26 · Financial Intelligence & Market Scanner (CodeRaksh Company)\n**Corporate Treasury, Pre-Market Chart Scanner, SEC EDGAR Earnings & Risk Guardian**\n\n### What it does:\n1. **Schedule Trigger (Daily Pre-Market)**: Runs before market opens to monitor assets, watchlist stocks, and treasury holdings.\n2. **Financial Data Aggregation**: Ingests market quotes, SEC EDGAR 8-K / 10-Q earnings summaries, and stock moves.\n3. **Claude Financial Analyst & Risk Guardian**:\n   - Assesses financial risk, stop-loss thresholds, and momentum breakouts.\n   - Enforces risk limits (max loss per trade, position caps).\n4. **Dispatches daily market briefing** to WhatsApp & Google Sheets.",
